   "content_index": 0,
   "text": "[commentary] Your October bill is high because it was based on an estimated 1,450 kilowatt hours, making it 147 euros and 0 cents, compared with 690 kilowatt hours and 72 euros and 52 cents in September. An actual October reading later came in at 720 kilowatt hours, so the estimate appears about 730 kilowatt hours too high. A billing advisor can review this for a correction or credit; they’re available Monday to Friday, 09:00 to 17:00.",
